      "end_time": 347.24
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't.",
      "speaker_name": "Simon Morris",
      "start_time": 347.24,
      "end_time": 347.88
    },
    {
      "text": "I would anticipate.",
      "speaker_name": "Simon Morris",
      "start_time": 348.76,
      "end_time": 350.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Not at this stage.",
      "speaker_name": "Simon Morris",
      "start_time": 350.16,
      "end_time": 351.72
    },
    {
      "text": "I.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 352.6,
      "end_time": 352.76
    },
    {
      "text": "And I will go over some of the numbers when we meet, if that's okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Simon Morris",
      "start_time": 352.83,
      "end_time": 356.03
    },
    {
      "text": "But as I say, it's really just a criteria of.",
      "speaker_name": "Simon Morris",
      "start_time": 356.03,
      "end_time": 360.35
    },
    {
      "text": "We like the look of it, we're very interested.",
      "speaker_name": "Simon Morris",
      "start_time": 360.83,
      "end_time": 363.31
    },
    {
      "text": "We just like to meet you and through sort of next steps that's cool.",
      "speaker_name": "Simon Morris",
      "start_time": 364.19,
      "end_time": 369.83
    },
    {
      "text": "Yep.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 369.83,
      "end_time": 370.27
    },
    {
      "text": "Great.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 371.39,
      "end_time": 371.79
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, I'll put that in the room and then look forward to seeing you then.",
      "speaker_name": "howard campion",
      "start_time": 372.67,
      "end_time": 375.87
    },
    {
      "text": "Brilliant.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 376.27,
      "end_time": 376.83
    },
    {
      "text": "That's very kind.",
      "speaker_name": "Simon Morris",
      "start_time": 376.91,
      "end_time": 377.71
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "howard campion",
      "start_time": 378.36,
      "end_time": 378.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Anything else you would want to know from me at this stage?",
      "speaker_name": "Simon Morris",
      "start_time": 379.48,
      "end_time": 381.96
    },
    {
      "text": "No, no, I, I, I think that the key for us is you've actually said two key things.",
      "speaker_name": "howard campion",
      "start_time": 382.2,
      "end_time": 386.84
    },
    {
      "text": "One is you're, you're happy with the numbers.",
      "speaker_name": "howard campion",
      "start_time": 387,
      "end_time": 390.08
    },
    {
      "text": "So there's, as you said, there's no gremlins in there.",
      "speaker_name": "howard campion",
      "start_time": 390.08,
      "end_time": 392.36
    },
    {
      "text": "It is, it is what it is.",
      "speaker_name": "howard campion",
      "start_time": 392.36,
      "end_time": 393.8
    },
    {
      "text": "And you've had a good dig around and the second part was not moving because there's a lot, there's a lot of add ons that you can, that you can bring in that I think will only then enhance the revenue.",
      "speaker_name": "howard campion",
      "start_time": 394.84,
      "end_time": 408.05
    },
    {
      "text": "And therefore, I think as we've said before, once we get to a certain revenue, anything over that, the, the profit tends to be slightly exponential on that.",
      "speaker_name": "howard campion",
      "start_time": 408.05,
      "end_time": 416.17
    },
    {
      "text": "So I think if you can be bringing things into that, then, then it will be a very successful business and.",
      "speaker_name": "howard campion",
      "start_time": 416.17,
      "end_time": 421.13
    },
    {
      "text": "Maybe we can pick that point up.",
      "speaker_name": "howard campion",
      "start_time": 421.13,
      "end_time": 422.329
    },
    {
      "text": "On, on Monday when we meet.",
      "speaker_name": "howard campion",
      "start_time": 422.329,
      "end_time": 423.65
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 423.65,
      "end_time": 424.57
    },
    {
      "text": "No, that's really good that, that fits guys.",
      "speaker_name": "Simon Morris",
      "start_time": 424.97,
      "end_time": 427.81
    },
    {
      "text": "So that's really, really kind.",
      "speaker_name": "Simon Morris",
      "start_time": 427.81,
      "end_time": 429.61
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you very much.",
      "speaker_name": "Simon Morris",
      "start_time": 429.61,
      "end_time": 430.41
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, mate, that's great.",
      "speaker_name": "howard campion",
      "start_time": 430.81,
      "end_time": 432.25
    },
    {
      "text": "Have a good rest of the week.",
      "speaker_name": "howard campion",
      "start_time": 433.24,
      "end_time": 434.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Cheers.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 435,
      "end_time": 435.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Bye bye.",
      "speaker_name": "howard campion",
      "start_time": 435.96,
      "end_time": 436.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Simon.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 438.84,
